tags.description:
Every invalid create and update request returns 400 Bad Request response with list of invalid fields and values.

#### Structure of 400 Bad Request response

```
{
    "message": "Invalid request",
    "violations": {
        "items": [
            {
                "code": "TOO_FEW_ERROR",
                "message": "This collection should contain 1 element or more."
            }
        ],
        "variable_symbol": [
            {
                "code": "IS_BLANK_ERROR",
                "message": "This value should not be blank."
            }
        ],
        "value": [
            {
                "code": "IS_BLANK_ERROR",
                "message": "This value should not be blank."
            }
        ],
        "recipient.address.name": [
            {
                "code": "IS_BLANK_ERROR",
                "message": "This value should not be blank."
            }
        ],
        "recipient.address.street": [
            {
                "code": "IS_BLANK_ERROR",
                "message": "This value should not be blank."
            }
        ],
        "recipient.address.city": [
            {
                "code": "IS_BLANK_ERROR",
                "message": "This value should not be blank."
            }
        ],
        "recipient.address.zip": [
            {
                "code": "IS_BLANK_ERROR",
                "message": "This value should not be blank."
            }
        ],
        "recipient.address.country": [
            {
                "code": "IS_BLANK_ERROR",
                "message": "This value should not be blank."
            }
        ],
        "recipient.contact": [
            {
                "code": "IS_BLANK_ERROR",
                "message": "This value should not be blank."
            }
        ]
    }
}
```
